\par\par \b \uc2 Chile Stocks End Higher As Retailers Jump On Soft CPI Data\b0\par\par\uc2 By Anthony Esposito   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 571 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Mai 2011\par 21:21\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--Chile's blue-chip Ipsa index closed higher Friday as weaker-than-expected data on consumer prices fueled retailers' shares.\par \par \uc2 The Ipsa rose 0.5% to 4813.64 points, while market volume slipped to 104.2 billion Chilean pesos ($222.7 million) from CLP272.5 billion the previous session.\par \par \uc2 After debuting the prior session on the Santiago Stock Exchange, specialty branded generic drugs manufacturer Recalcine (CFR.SN) leapt 20.4% to CLP116.00, having surged a combined 36.5% in its first two days of trading.\par \par \uc2 "There's a lot of optimism and effervescence around Recalcine. A lot of investors were left out of the IPO [initial public offering] and are now buying up shares," said Andres Galarce, analyst with local brokerage EuroAmerica.\par \par \uc2 The softer-than-expected CPI data boosted retailers as participants expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow the pace of interest rate increases next week to 25 basis points, a move that would support demand.\par \par \uc2 The CPI grew 0.3% in April from the previous month, the government statistics institute reported earlier in the session, lower than the 0.4% increase participants were expecting.\par \par \uc2 The nation's largest department store, Falabella (FALABELLA.SN), gained 2.0% to CLP5,080.00 and retail holding giant \uc2 Cencosud\uc2  (CENCOSUD.SN) expanded 0.6% to CLP3,540.00. Retailers La Polar (LAPOLAR.SN) grew 2.2% to CLP2,715.00 and Ripley (RIPLEY.SN) increased 1.5% to CLP619.00.\par \par \uc2 Shipper Vapores (VAPORES.SN), however, declined 2.2% to CLP358.00 after its first quarter net loss widened nearly fivefold to $186.4 million on surging fuel costs and lower shipping rates.\par \par \uc2 Also, as several of the Ipsa's heavier-weighted shares also trade in New York, the Ipsa often tracks the Dow Jones Industrial Average. In recent trading the DJIA rose 60 points, or 0.5%, to 12645 on surprisingly strong U.S. jobs data, although speculation that Greece could leave the euro zone --something Greek officials quickly denied-- pared some earlier gains.\par \par \uc2 Among dually listed shares flagship carrier \uc2 LAN Airlines\uc2  (LFL, LAN.SN) gained 1.7% to CLP13,420.00, power generator \uc2 Endesa\uc2  (EOC, ENDESA.SN) rose 1.7% to CLP877.00 and beverage company CCU (CCU, CCU.SN) climbed 2.2% to CLP5,590.00.\par \par \uc2 In other market news, the peso ended stronger versus the dollar, erasing earlier losses, after the stronger-than-expected U.S. payrolls data boosted copper prices.\par \par \uc2 The peso gained to CLP467.80 to the dollar, versus Thursday's close of CLP468.40, while trading in a wide range of CLP465.00 to CLP471.50.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as part of its $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program, purchased $50 million on Friday at an average rate of CLP470.02. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has accumulated $4.35 billion so far this year.\par \par \uc2 In the bond market, yields on inflation-indexed Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bonds, or BCUs, ended higher on the CPI data.\par \par \uc2 The yield on five-year BCU bonds ended at 2.62%, from 2.57% on Thursday, while the yield on 10-year BCUs closed at 2.90%, versus 2.87% the prior session.\par \par \uc2 (Peso and bond quotes provided by Valor Futuro newswire.)\par \par \uc2 -By Anthony Esposito, Dow Jones Newswires; 56-2-715-8929; anthony.esposito@dowjones.com [ 06-05-11 1921GMT ]\par \par \uc2 5057   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020110506e756001ft\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
