\par\par \b \uc2 DJ  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Minister: Peso Would Be At CLP450 Without  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 234 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 April 2011\par 15:29\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--Without the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program and the government's budget cuts, the peso would be trading at around CLP450 to the dollar, Finance Minister Felipe Larrain said Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Early Wednesday, the peso was trading at a three-year high of CLP461.90 to the dollar, which is also a level not seen since early January, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced its $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program.\par \par \uc2 In addition to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the government reduced this year's fiscal budget by $800 million and implemented other measures to keep the peso competitive against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The Chilean economy is highly dependent on exports, and a stronger peso makes its products less competitive abroad.\par \par \uc2 Larrain told reporters the government will continue to monitor the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and implement additional measures if these are needed.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Jose De Gregorio reiterated the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  wouldn't implement capital controls since there isn't a net dollar inflow.\par \par \uc2 On previous occasions, both Larrain and De Gregorio have said the capital controls Chile implemented in the 1990s weren't effective at curbing speculative inflows.\par \par \uc2 (Peso quote provided by Valor Futuro newswire.)\par \par \uc2 -By Carolina Pica, Dow Jones Newswires; 56-2-715-8919; carolina.pica@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 April 27, 2011 09:29 ET (13:29 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020110427e74r0042z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
