\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ  \highlight22\uc2 Chile Central Bank \highlight\uc2 : Peso Would Be Stronger Without  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 April 2011\par 15:44\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2011 09:45 EDT *DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Monetary Policy Faces Inflationary Challenges\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2011 09:46 EDT *DJ  Chile \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Says It Will Continue Raising Interest Rates\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2011 09:47 EDT *DJ  Chile \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Sees Domestic Core Inflation Contained\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2011 10:08 EDT DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Peso Would Be Stronger Without \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday reiterated that without its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the peso would be stronger in relation to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 In early 2011, the bank announced a $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which was trading at near three-year highs.\par \par \uc2 In a prepared remarks to Congress, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Jose De Gregorio said monetary policy currently faces challenges stemming from significant international inflationary pressures as a result of rising international fuel and food prices.\par \par \uc2 While these imported pressures will push inflation in Chile to end the year at 4.3%, above the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's target of 3%, plus/minus one percentage point, core inflation, which factors out fuel and food prices will remain relatively stable.\par \par \uc2 "Core inflation will hover at around the target level throughout the bank's [24-month] policy horizon," De Gregorio said in his speech.\par \par \uc2 He reiterated the bank will continue withdrawing its monetary stimulus to keep inflation in line.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has increased the benchmark rate a total 75 basis points, bringing it to 4%.\par \par \uc2 Analysts expect the benchmark rate to end the year around 5.5% to 6%.\par \par \uc2 -By Carolina Pica, Dow Jones Newswires; 56-2-715-8919; carolina.pica@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 April 04, 2011 10:08 ET (14:08 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020110404e7440034d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
