ly poll of traders. [ID:nN23232413]\par \par \uc2 Traders say interest rate futures show the market expects the bank to raise its key rate <CLINTR=ECI> by 75 basis points over the next three months.\par \par \uc2 For Chile's statistics agency website for IP data, please see: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.ine.cl"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.ine.cl}}}\par \par \uc2 For all Chile economic data, please double-click: <ECONALLCL>.\par \par \uc2 For today's data, please double-click: <ECONCL>\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Maria Jose Latorre; Editing by Kenneth Barry)\par \par \uc2 CHILE/INDUSTRIALOUTPUT (PREVIEW)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110328e73s001i5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
