\par\par \b \uc2 TAKE-A-LOOK-Chile grapples with rates, peso amid rebound\b0\par\par\uc2 879 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2011\par 22:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it would allow more foreigners to issue bonds in pesos in the domestic market as it seeks ways to battle a sharp rally in the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The measure accompanies a rebound in the peso <CLP=CL> after it fell on a $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program introduced in January when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose to its strongest level in nearly three years.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has focused on inflationary pressures over concerns about the strong peso, joining a host of emerging markets from China to Brazil in raising interest rates, which in turn attract foreign capital inflows. [ID:nN1086700]\par \par \uc2 For stories, please double click on the codes in brackets:\par \par \uc2 PESO \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  > \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  relaxes peso bond regs to tame \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  [ID:nN10144530] > \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  cenbank maintains pace of \b \highlight22\uc2 fx intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  [ID:nSAG002748] > \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  reforms raise speculation cost:Fin Ministry[ID:nN28275783] > SCENARIOS-Fresh options to tame Chile peso slim [ID:nN17130996] > Any capital controls need careful study:cenbank [ID:nN13248243] > Chile eyes local financing of foreign firms [ID:nN24189054] > Chile peso firms despite cenbank rate hold [ID:nN14138372] > FACTBOX-Steps countries taking against hot money [ID:nSGE69503F] > FACTBOX-Steps Latin Amer