\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Chile seen raising rate 25 bps in March-cbank poll\b0\par\par\uc2 278 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2011\par 12:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Traders see March inflation spiking 0.7 percent\par \par \uc2 * Three-month peso forecast stronger than pre-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 (Updates with March inflation, three0month peso forecasts)\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, March 9 (Reuters) - Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is seen raising its benchmark interest rate by 25 basis points to 3.75 percent at its March monetary policy meeting next week, a new fortnightly \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  poll of traders showed on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Consumer prices are seen jumping by 0.7 percent in March, according to the median forecast of more than 40 traders, after a modest 0.2 percent rise in February. [ID:nN08170095]\par \par \uc2 While most traders forecast a median 25 bps rate increase at its March 17 rate-setting meeting, some respondents saw the bank opting for a more aggressive 50 basis-point increase.\par \par \uc2 In February, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  resumed a cycle of rate increases after a pause in January, prioritizing inflation concerns over worries about a strong peso and lifting the rate by 25 basis points.\par \par \uc2 The bank is seen raising its key rate to 5.25 percent in 6 months time, the poll showed.\par \par \uc2 Sustained interest rate increases and record prices of main export copper have strengthened Chile's peso toward nearly three-year highs despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to tame \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strength. [ID:nN17130996]\par \par \uc2 Traders' three-month exchange rate forecasts, which jumped to 500 pesos per dollar after the bank launched its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in January, have shifted to 470 per dollar in two months -- strengthening past pre-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  forecasts.\par \par \uc2 ( Reporting by Brad Haynes, Editing by W Simon )\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CHILE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CENBANK/POLL (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110309e739000kr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
