\par\par \b \uc2 TAKE-A-LOOK-Chile grapples with rates, peso amid rebound\b0\par\par\uc2 758 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Februar 2011\par 23:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday raised its benchmark interest rate and signaled more hikes were on the way as it prioritizes inflation worries over its concerns about a strong peso that is hammering exporters.\par \par \uc2 The 25 basis-point hike to 3.5 percent, which had been widely expected, will probably put more pressure to the peso which has risen on strong prices for Chile's main export, copper, and wider dollar weakness.\par \par \uc2 The peso is trading near 3-year highs despite a $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 For stories, please double click on the codes in brackets:\par \par \uc2 RATE RISE CYCLE > Chile raises key rate 25 bps despite strong peso [ID:nN17302923] \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par > INSTANT VIEW-Chile cenbank raise key rate        [ID:nN17133833]\par > TEXT-Chile cenbank raises rate by 25 bps         [ID:nN17194578]\par > For a graphic on Latam inflation     \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://r.reuters.com/gep87r"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://r.reuters.com/gep87r}}}\uc2 \f2 \par > For a graphic on Chile peso          \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://r.reuters.com/sew97r"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://r.reuters.com/sew97r}}}\uc2 \f2 \par > For a Reuters Insider report      \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/cew97r"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/cew97r}}}\uc2 \f2 \par > FACTBOX-Latin American interest rates            [ID:nN20ATAMRA]\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 > Chile gov't,cbank trying to contain prices:Finmin[ID:nN1778803] > Chile market sees 25 bps rate hike: cbank report [ID:nN16187946] > Reuters poll: Chile cenbank to raise rate 25 bps 