\par\par \b \uc2 Chile Peso Ends Weaker On Copper, Institutional Dollar Buys\b0\par\par\uc2 By Anthony Esposito   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 509 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Februar 2011\par 18:06\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--Chile's peso closed weaker against the dollar Wednesday, as international copper prices retreated and institutional investors bought dollars.\par \par \uc2 The peso ended at CLP473.70 to the dollar, compared with CLP472.40 on Tuesday, while trading in a range of CLP473.00 to CLP475.00.\par \par \uc2 As Chile is the world's premier copper producer, accounting for nearly a third of global supply, the peso often takes trading cues from the metal's international prices.\par \par \uc2 In London trading, spot copper prices fell 1.8% to $4.50191 per pound, according to Chile's state copper commission Cochilco, as inventories of copper stored in London Metal Exchange warehouses rose.\par \par \uc2 Dollar purchases by banks and Chile's private pension fund managers, helped to weaken the peso, said Felipe Herrera, trader with local brokerage EuroAmerica.\par \par \uc2 Also, the euro's slip against the dollar after stronger-than-expected U.S. data, helped to push the peso lower.\par \par \uc2 As Chile's economy is highly export-dependent and about a third of its products are bound for European ports, the peso often moves in the same direction as the euro does against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Despite the peso's recent slip, analysts expect the peso will continue gaining to levels it was trading at before the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced in early January a $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program if the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  raises interest rates.\par \par \uc2 Interest rate hikes tend to foster capital inflows, as participants seek better returns.\par \par \uc2 "The market expects an interest rate hike of 25 basis points, that will help pressure the peso to strengthen a bit, but if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  surprises everyone with a 50-basis-points hike, the peso's gains will be much greater," said Nicolas Maqueda, head \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at local brokerage Cruz del Sur Corredora de Bolsa.\par \par \uc2 Over the last several weeks, the peso has pared back most of its post-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  losses on rising international copper prices, expectations for robust domestic growth and anticipations for continued rate hikes.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as part of its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program, purchased $50 million at an average rate of CLP474.40. It has accumulated $1.55 billion so far this year.\par \par \uc2 In the bond market, yields on inflation-indexed Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bonds, or BCUs, ended lower as inflation expectations for 2011 have deteriorated in recent days, said Sebastian Ide, head of market making and fixed income at investment bank Santander GBM.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's latest Monthly Survey of Analysts' Expectations revealed that economists see inflation ending the year at 4%, from a previous 3.6% forecast.\par \par \uc2 The yield on five-year BCU bonds at 2.66%, from 2.71% on Tuesday, while the yield on 10-year BCUs closed at 3.16%. from 3.22% the prior session.\par \par \uc2 (Peso and bond quotes provided by Valor Futuro newswire.)\par \par \uc2 -By Anthony Esposito, Dow Jones Newswires; 56-2-715-8929; anthony.esposito@dowjones.com [ 16-02-11 1706GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1170 1844   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020110216e72g001ch\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
