\par\par \b \uc2 TAKE-A-LOOK-Chile grapples with rates, peso amid rebound\b0\par\par\uc2 566 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Januar 2011\par 16:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is very worried about rising inflation and its monetary policy will not be subordinated to the exchange rate, the bank's chief Jose De Gregorio told a local daily in an interview published on Sunday.\par \par \uc2 De Gregorio said future rate increases are likely after a surprising pause in January in what the market saw as a complement to a $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  aimed at taming the stronger local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hurting exporters.\par \par \uc2 For stories, please double click on the codes in brackets:\par \par \uc2 RATE RISE CYCLE > Chile cbank says very worried about inflation [ID:nN23124482] > \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  cenbank holds rate, aiding \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  [ID:nN13283103] > For a graphic, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://r.reuters.com/ren36r"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://r.reuters.com/ren36r}}}\uc2  > INSTANT VIEW-Chile cenbank holds rate [ID:nN13283914] > TEXT-Chile cenbank keeps key rate steady [ID:nN13105441] > Chile cbank seen upping rate to $3.5 pct - poll [ID:nSAG002685] > \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  cenbank: rate unfettered by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  [ID:nN16258167] > \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  analysts evenly split on rate hike, pause [ID:nSAG002684] > Chile cenbank weighed holding rate steady in Dec [ID:nN03172599] > Chile cenbank hikes rate in Dec, S&P ups outlook [ID:nN16263976] > Chile rates to rise in coming months-cbank member[ID:nN10280261] > INTERVIEW-Chile plans no \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls-finmin [ID:nN08249